==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustrations feature various forms of {{p|Furfrou}}:
**The 206/226 illustration features the Natural Form of Furfrou.
**The 207/226 illustration features the Heart Trim of Furfrou.
**The 208/226 illustration features the Pharaoh Trim of Furfrou.
*{{a|Fur Coat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Furfrou}} can have.
*'''Sharp Fang'''{{'}}s Japanese name is that of the [[Razor Fang]], a [[held item]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Hidden Legends|Golbat|36}} from the {{TCG|EX Hidden Legends}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

